#atf: lang akk 
@tablet 
@obverse 
1. _4(barig) sze_ 
#tr.ts: erbet pān âm
#tr.en: 240 litres of barley

2. _{gesz}ba-ri2-ga {d}amar-utu_ sza nam-har-tim 
#tr.ts: parsikti marduk ša namḫartim
#tr.en: (measured) by the parsiktu-measure of Marduk for the receipts,

3. szi-i-iq me-sze-qi2-im bi-ru-ia-im 
#tr.ts: šīq mešēqim biruyaim
#tr.en: according to the medium misure,

4. _sza3 3(gesz2) sze gur_ sza _e2-gal_ 
#tr.ts: libbu šalāsat šūš kur îm ša ekallim
#tr.en: part of the 180 kor of palace barley

5. sza {d}utu-szu-mu-un-dib _ugula dam-gar3_ 
#tr.ts: ša utu-šumundib akil tamkārim
#tr.en: which Utu-šumundib, the overseer of the merchant(s),

6. i-na na-at-ba-ak zimbir{ki}-am-na-nim 
#tr.ts: ina natbak sippir-amnānim
#tr.en: at the granary of Sippar-amnānum

7. a-na sze-se-e-ma 
#tr.ts: ana šīsima
#tr.en: for the summon

8. im-hu-ru 
#tr.ts: imḫuru
#tr.en: received,

9. _ki_ {d}utu-szu-mu-un-dib _ugula dam-gar3_ 
#tr.ts: itti utu-šumundib akil tamkārim
#tr.en: from Utu-šumundib the overseer of the merchant(s),

10. {disz}i-id-di-i dumu szu-mu-um-li-ib-szi 
#tr.ts: iddī mār šumum-libši
#tr.en: Iddī son of Šumum-libši

11. u3 ib-ba-tum _dumu_ sig-an-nu-ni-tum 
#tr.ts: u ibbatum mār ipqu-annunītum
#tr.en: and Ibbatum son of Ipqu-annunītum

12. _szu ba-an-ti-mesz_ 
#tr.ts: ilqû
#tr.en: have borrowed.

